1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,050
MIRA: Mom! Stop!

2
00:00:01,050 --> 00:00:02,732
MOM: What? It's my pill.

3
00:00:02,750 --> 00:00:04,030
MIRA: You already took it!

4
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:05,507
MOM: ...Did I?

5
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:08,000
MOM: One more won't hurt. Just to be safe.

6
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,686
MIRA: That's what you said yesterday!

7
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:11,700
MIRA: Three gone. It's only Tuesday.

8
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,811
MOM: The strip doesn't say which day!

9
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:15,286
MIRA: Then we use this.

10
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:17,750
MOM: ...Did I?

11
00:00:17,750 --> 00:00:19,700
MIRA: Wednesday's empty. You took it.

12
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,300
MOM: And if I forget again?

13
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,697
MIRA: Check ten times. Still one pill.

14
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:25,580
Doing it twice should only count once.

15
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:27,130
That's called idempotency.

16
00:00:27,130 --> 00:00:30,180
It's why tapping Pay twice doesn't charge you twice.

17
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:32,680
MOM: Then I'll take Thursday's now.

18
00:00:32,680 --> 00:00:34,105
MOM: Saves time.
